         <div class="container">
            <h2 class="mt-8" style="text-align: center;">The Educational Leader on Florida’s Space Coast</h2>
            
            <p style="text-align: center;"><span data-teams="true">Your goals matter—and we’re here to help you reach them. Whether you’re pursuing a
                  degree or fast-track career training, we’ll help you build skills, gain confidence,
                  and launch a future you’re proud of. This is where Titans rise.</span></p>
            
            <p style="text-align: center;"><a class="efsc-cta" title="Start Your Journey" href="/academics/index.php"><span>Start Your Journey</span><em><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" width="24px" height="24px" viewBox="0 0 34 34" version="1.1">
                        <g stroke="none" stroke-width="1" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd">
                           <g>
                              <circle class="oval fill-current" cx="17" cy="17" r="17"/>
