         </div>
         <div class="container">
            <div class="my-16">
               <div class="my-16">
                  <div class="promo-panel">
                     <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mt-8">
                        <div class="text-white bg-blue-primary justify-between flex flex-col"><a title="Exploring Career Pathways Information Session with STARCOM" href="https://events.easternflorida.edu/event/20425-exploring-career-pathways-information-session-with-sta"><img class="object-cover w-full" title="Discover Your Future with Starcom" src="/images/home-cta/starcom-event-500x500.jpg" alt="An image with the Starcom logo and the words Discover Your Future with Starcom" width="500" height="500"></a><div class="px-6 py-8 justify-between flex flex-col flex-grow">
